    },
    {
      "end": 40.52000045776367,
      "text": "I'm a B***h and damn it, full of stress that's unaddressed",
      "start": 37.779998779296875
    },
    {
      "end": 43.02000045776367,
      "text": "I always feel like last, blessed, least, best",
      "start": 40.52000045776367
    },
    {
      "end": 46.08000183105469,
      "text": "Haven't been well rested since last time I was arrested",
      "start": 43.02000045776367
    },
    {
      "end": 49.220001220703125,
      "text": "Turned this mood into compassion, hope something's impressive",
      "start": 46.08000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 52.52000045776367,
      "text": "Though I don't feel I'm respected, demons are neglected",
      "start": 49.220001220703125
    },
    {
      "end": 55.79999923706055,
      "text": "Shadows are my best friends, they know that I'm reckless",
      "start": 52.52000045776367
    },
    {
      "end": 58.79999923706055,
      "text": "Young and got a death wish, cause if you really know me",
      "start": 55.79999923706055
    },
    {
      "end": 61.959999084472656,
      "text": "You know that I'm always lonely, you know I ain't got no homies",
      "start": 58.79999923706055
    },
    {
      "end": 65.36000061035156,
      "text": "And most of the time I'm dope sick, houseless, not homeless",
      "start": 62
    },
    {
      "end": 69.37999725341797,
      "text": "Hopeful, not hopeless, I'm breaking hearts cause someone left mine broken",
      "start": 65.68000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 72.68000030517578,
      "text": "Lost my time with token, when it comes to dunkey things",
      "start": 69.37999725341797
    },
    {
      "end": 75.80000305175781,
      "text": "I partake in everything, Xanax bars and cups of saline",
      "start": 72.69999694824219
    },
    {
      "end": 79.08000183105469,
      "text": "Trays on trays of black tar, arms and neck from having scars",
